## Interface: 16001
## Title: DeckUIForever Questing
## Notes: DeckUIForever module: a quest compendium, the NPC dialog on autopilot, reward marks and a quest item key
## Author: Gottlieb
## Version: 1.5.1
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\DeckUIForever\textures\face_a
## X-Website: https://github.com/JonasAudren/DeckUIForever
## X-Category: Quests & Leveling
## Dependencies: DeckUIForever
## LoadOnDemand: 1
# No OptionalDeps on Questie: the hub loads this module inside its own
# ADDON_LOADED, long before the game reaches Questie's place in the addon
# list, and an optional dependency made the game load Questie and
# QuestieDB right then, on demand and out of order - after which Questie
# never started (owner, 2026-11-08). questdata.lua looks for Questie at
# runtime and needs no load order.
## SavedVariables: DeckUIForeverQuestingDB, DeckUIForeverQuestDataDB

# core first (defaults, the pause key, the event hub), then our own quest
# data (the shipped file, the recorder, the scanner), the data layer and
# the chains the compendium reads, then the window, then the helpers
# that act at the NPC; config last.
core.lua
data_forever.lua
record.lua
scan.lua
questdata.lua
import.lua
chains.lua
compendium.lua
dialog.lua
rewards.lua
zone.lua
questitem.lua
config.lua
